            "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/mht_cet/Lxbwup4-Amc5ZFkltVoCGUZmNhmwRteXrqL8Ihw8TMc.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\nLet the corner points of the feasible region be A, $\\mathrm{B}, \\mathrm{C}, \\mathrm{D}$.\nSolving equations $y=, 3$ and $2 x+3 y=12$, we get\n$\\mathrm{A}=(1.5,3)$\nSimilarly,\n$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\mathrm{B}=(4,3) \\\\\n& \\mathrm{C}=(4,7) \\\\\n& \\mathrm{D}=\\left(\\frac{3}{5}, \\frac{18}{5}\\right)\n\\end{aligned}$\nLet $Z=3 x+5 y$\n$\\therefore \\quad$ Value of $Z$ at point $A=19.5$\nValue of $Z$ at point $B=27$\nValue of $Z$ at point $C=47$\nValue of $Z$ at point $D=\\frac{99}{5}$\n$\\therefore \\quad$ The minimum value of $Z$ is 19.5 .",
